      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>First public release of Sync Bar.</li><li>Sync handwritten reMarkable notes to Notion, Google Docs, Linear, Apple Notes, and Markdown files.</li><li>Transcribe on-device with Apple Vision, or add your own OpenAI or Anthropic key for higher accuracy and hand-drawn diagrams turned into Mermaid charts.</li><li>Folder-based rules: every note in a folder becomes one destination entry, updated in place when you edit it instead of duplicated.</li><li>Per-destination controls including Notion property mapping, Linear tag filtering, and Google Drive folder selection.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
